public namespace TavilyDataProvider {
#! The countries Tavily will boost search results for
/** Tavily rejects any other value with <tt>"Invalid country"</tt>, so this is a closed set and the
    option is a dropdown rather than free text - a user cannot otherwise know that \c "vatican city"
    is not one of them and \c "trinidad and tobago" is.

    The values are the lowercase names Tavily's own documentation publishes; the API matches them
    without regard to case.
*/
